  "title": "Data, apps, and agents: the future of app dev with Rayfin",
  "description": "Apps are coming to the data platform. With Rayfin, your entire backend is expressed in code—and Rayfin translates it into the services it needs: databases, functions, and more. Write the code yourself, or describe your app and let agents generate it for you. Either way, deploy with the CLI as a secure, scalable solution. With native access to Fabric data, analytics, and AI, Rayfin eliminates backend stitching so teams move from idea to impact faster.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
